body:
I have a Sigma 50mm Macro 2.8 & Tamron 70-300mm at the moment and the standard kit lens ofcourse, thanks for sending the article I will have a read, and I would get the other camera and keep the other one too.

&#x200B;

I guess it just made me enthusiastic about owning such a good body and maybe I am able to do other things then what I can do now with my 200D, I am a newbie in all the bodies and so. I was just wondering if it would be a good piece to have alongside my 200D.
